  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 3002.04 “Commission” means the New Hampshire lottery commission established pursuant to RSA 284:21-a, or its designated staff having authority to perform administrative and clerical functions for the commission.\n\nSource. #13041, eff 5-9-20",
